{
  "info": {
    "name": "Movie Ticket Booking API",
    "_postman_id": "movie-ticket-booking-api",
    "description": "Complete API collection for the Movie Ticket Booking system.\n\n## Setup\n1. Run the Spring Boot app (port 8080, PostgreSQL required)\n2. Use **Auth → Admin Login** to get an admin JWT — it is saved automatically as `adminToken`\n3. Use **Auth → Register Customer** then **Auth → Customer Login** — saved as `customerToken`\n4. Follow the numbered flow inside each folder top-to-bottom\n\n## Collection Variables\n| Variable | Description |\n|---|---|\n| `baseUrl` | API base URL (default: http://localhost:8080) |\n| `adminToken` | Set automatically after Admin Login |\n| `customerToken` | Set automatically after Customer Login |\n| `cityId` | Set automatically after Create City |\n| `theaterId` | Set automatically after Create Theater |\n| `screenId` | Set automatically after Create Screen |\n| `movieId` | Set automatically after Create Movie |\n| `showId` | Set automatically after Create Show |\n| `showSeatId1` | Set from Get Seat Map |\n| `showSeatId2` | Set from Get Seat Map |\n| `bookingId` | Set automatically after Create Booking |\n| `discountCodeId` | Set automatically after Create Discount Code |",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "customerToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "cityId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "theaterId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "screenId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "movieId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "showId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "showSeatId1", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "showSeatId2", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "bookingId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "discountCodeId", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Registration and login endpoints. Run these first to obtain JWT tokens.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register Customer",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('customerToken', json.token);",
                  "    console.log('Customer registered. Token saved.');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"John Doe\",\n  \"email\": \"john@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "register"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Admin Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', json.token);",
                  "    console.log('Admin logged in. Token saved.');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@movieticket.com\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Customer Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('customerToken', json.token);",
                  "    console.log('Customer logged in. Token saved.');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"john@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
